{"input": "Buat decorator Python yang mengukur dan mencetak waktu eksekusi sebuah fungsi.", "output": "WRITE — Python execution-time decorator\n\n```python\nimport time\nimport functools\n\ndef timed(fn):\n    @functools.wraps(fn)\n    def wrapper(*args, **kwargs):\n        start = time.perf_counter()\n        result = fn(*args, **kwargs)\n        elapsed = time.perf_counter() - start\n        print(f\"{fn.__name__} took {elapsed:.4f}s\")\n        return result\n    return wrapper\n```"}
