{"input": "Buat fungsi JavaScript untuk deep clone sebuah object, termasuk nested object dan array (tanpa pakai JSON.stringify).", "output": "WRITE — JavaScript deep clone (handles Array, Date, plain object)\n\n```javascript\nfunction deepClone(value) {\n  if (value === null || typeof value !== 'object') return value;\n  if (value instanceof Date) return new Date(value.getTime());\n  if (Array.isArray(value)) return value.map(deepClone);\n  const result = {};\n  for (const key in value) {\n    if (Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(value, key)) {\n      result[key] = deepClone(value[key]);\n    }\n  }\n  return result;\n}\n```"}
{"input": "Buat fungsi generic TypeScript untuk mengelompokkan array of object berdasarkan salah satu key-nya.", "output": "WRITE — TypeScript generic groupBy\n\n```typescript\nfunction groupBy<T, K extends keyof T>(items: T[], key: K): Record<string, T[]> {\n  return items.reduce((acc, item) => {\n    const groupKey = String(item[key]);\n    if (!acc[groupKey]) acc[groupKey] = [];\n    acc[groupKey].push(item);\n    return acc;\n  }, {} as Record<string, T[]>);\n}\n```"}
{"input": "Buat fungsi JavaScript fetch wrapper dengan retry otomatis (misal 3x) kalau request gagal.", "output": "WRITE — JavaScript fetch with retry + backoff\n\n```javascript\nasync function fetchWithRetry(url, options = {}, retries = 3, delayMs = 500) {\n  for (let attempt = 1; attempt <= retries; attempt++) {\n    try {\n      const res = await fetch(url, options);\n      if (!res.ok) throw new Error(`HTTP ${res.status}`);\n      return res;\n    } catch (err) {\n      if (attempt === retries) throw err;\n      await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, delayMs * attempt));\n    }\n  }\n}\n```"}
{"input": "Buat custom React hook useFetch untuk fetch data dari URL, dengan state loading, error, dan data.", "output": "WRITE — React useFetch hook\n\n```javascript\nimport { useState, useEffect } from 'react';\n\nfunction useFetch(url) {\n  const [data, setData] = useState(null);\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true);\n  const [error, setError] = useState(null);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    let cancelled = false;\n    setLoading(true);\n    fetch(url)\n      .then(res => {\n        if (!res.ok) throw new Error(`HTTP ${res.status}`);\n        return res.json();\n      })\n      .then(json => { if (!cancelled) setData(json); })\n      .catch(err => { if (!cancelled) setError(err); })\n      .finally(() => { if (!cancelled) setLoading(false); });\n    return () => { cancelled = true; };\n  }, [url]);\n\n  return { data, loading, error };\n}\n```\n\nNotes:\n- `cancelled` guard prevents a state update after the component unmounts."}
