{"input": "Buat fungsi C untuk reverse string in-place (tanpa buat string baru).", "output": "WRITE — C in-place string reverse\n\n```c\nvoid reverse_string(char *s) {\n    if (s == NULL) return;\n    int left = 0;\n    int right = 0;\n    while (s[right] != '\\0') right++;\n    right--;\n    while (left < right) {\n        char tmp = s[left];\n        s[left] = s[right];\n        s[right] = tmp;\n        left++;\n        right--;\n    }\n}\n```"}
{"input": "Buat implementasi C untuk singly linked list dengan fungsi insert di depan dan delete berdasarkan value.", "output": "WRITE — C singly linked list (insert_front, delete_value)\n\n```c\ntypedef struct Node {\n    int value;\n    struct Node *next;\n} Node;\n\nvoid insert_front(Node **head, int value) {\n    Node *node = malloc(sizeof(Node));\n    node->value = value;\n    node->next = *head;\n    *head = node;\n}\n\nvoid delete_value(Node **head, int value) {\n    Node *curr = *head;\n    Node *prev = NULL;\n    while (curr != NULL) {\n        if (curr->value == value) {\n            if (prev == NULL) {\n                *head = curr->next;\n            } else {\n                prev->next = curr->next;\n            }\n            free(curr);\n            return;\n        }\n        prev = curr;\n        curr = curr->next;\n    }\n}\n```\n\nNotes:\n- `insert_front`/`delete_value` take `Node **head` so they can update the caller's head pointer."}
{"input": "Buat fungsi C untuk menyalin string dengan aman (hindari buffer overflow), mirip strcpy tapi dibatasi ukuran buffer tujuan.", "output": "WRITE — C bounded string copy\n\n```c\nvoid safe_strcpy(char *dest, size_t dest_size, const char *src) {\n    if (dest_size == 0) return;\n    size_t i = 0;\n    for (; i < dest_size - 1 && src[i] != '\\0'; i++) {\n        dest[i] = src[i];\n    }\n    dest[i] = '\\0';\n}\n```\n\nNotes:\n- Always leaves room for the null terminator, unlike raw `strncpy`, which does not guarantee termination if `src` is longer than `dest_size`."}
{"input": "Buat implementasi dynamic array sederhana di C (bisa resize otomatis kalau penuh), dengan fungsi push.", "output": "WRITE — C resizable dynamic array (push with capacity doubling)\n\n```c\ntypedef struct {\n    int *data;\n    size_t size;\n    size_t capacity;\n} IntArray;\n\nvoid array_init(IntArray *arr) {\n    arr->data = NULL;\n    arr->size = 0;\n    arr->capacity = 0;\n}\n\nvoid array_push(IntArray *arr, int value) {\n    if (arr->size == arr->capacity) {\n        size_t new_capacity = arr->capacity == 0 ? 4 : arr->capacity * 2;\n        int *new_data = realloc(arr->data, new_capacity * sizeof(int));\n        if (new_data == NULL) return; /* caller should check arr->size afterward on OOM */\n        arr->data = new_data;\n        arr->capacity = new_capacity;\n    }\n    arr->data[arr->size++] = value;\n}\n```"}
